        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The words of wisdom left here by the Lord Ravager known as \"Celenova\":"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "From across the void of space and time, I witnessed a single soul embark on a cosmic journey."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And in that instant, a billion clocks began to turn."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If the doom of the cosmos does not arrive with the birth of Irontomb, it will be..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "in that moment when the stars will scatter like frightened birds,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and all that is harmony and discord, perfect and incomplete, just fall into oblivion."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
